            "review_text": "CHIU W\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam357 contributions\n0\nEat well.\nSep 2025 • Family\n\"There is some good food, the soup is sweet, beef is sweet, the price is equal, eating together and wanting to go, the owner knows Chinese and Japanese, communication is completely no problem.\"\nThe service staff is warmly attentive, the manager is warmly attentive, the taste of Vietnamese powder is beautiful. The restaurant environment is clean and clean, beef is fresh, the aroma is nasal. Prices are also reasonable in this area, there is very little meat, the restaurant has just opened, and people are crowded. The restaurant has air-conditioned cabins and 2-3 outdoor dining tables. The restaurant is open in the noon and evening, but does not sell Vietnamese powder. I'll eat it again and share it with everyone.\nRead more\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten September 10, 2025",
